  "description": "<p>Lavazza Qualita Rossa Coffee Beans offer a unique blend of&nbsp;Robusta and Arabica&nbsp;beans featuring an aromatic, smooth, well-rounded flavour.&nbsp;A versatile full-bodied and strong coffee, great with or without milk. There are hints of chocolate and dried fruit offering a sweet aroma on the senses with a full and sustained taste.&nbsp;Each blend is expertly selected, roasted and ground, as specified by our quality standards.</p><ul><li>Arabica &amp; Robusta</li><li>Hints of Chocolate &amp; Dried Fruit</li><li>Full-Bodied &amp; Strong</li><li>1kg</li></ul>"
